   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 232\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig\" role=\"img\">\n<line x1=\"66.00\" y1=\"134.00\" x2=\"131.00\" y2=\"134.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"131.00\" y1=\"134.00\" x2=\"131.00\" y2=\"173.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"131.00\" y1=\"173.00\" x2=\"66.00\" y2=\"173.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"66.00\" y1=\"173.00\" x2=\"66.00\" y2=\"134.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"187.00\" y1=\"56.00\" x2=\"382.00\" y2=\"56.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"382.00\" y1=\"56.00\" x2=\"382.00\" y2=\"173.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"382.00\" y1=\"173.00\" x2=\"187.00\" y2=\"173.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"187.00\" y1=\"173.00\" x2=\"187.00\" y2=\"56.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"98.50\" y=\"195.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">5 cm</text>\n<text x=\"284.50\" y=\"195.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">15 cm</text>\n<text x=\"98.50\" y=\"124.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">A</text>\n<text x=\"284.50\" y=\"44.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">B</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"42\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">NOT TO</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"62\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">SCALE</text>\n</svg>",
   "stem": "<p>Rectangle <i>A</i> and rectangle <i>B</i> are mathematically similar.<br>The area of rectangle <i>A</i> is 15&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Write down the scale factor of the enlargement from <i>A</i> to <i>B</i>.",
     "ans": "",
     "m": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "Work out the area of rectangle <i>B</i>.",
     "ans": "",
     "unit": "cm<sup>2</sup>",
     "m": 2
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "3",
     "1",
     "B1<br><sup>15</sup>&frasl;<sub>5</sub>"
    ],
    [
     "135",
     "2",
     "M1 for 15 &times; 3<sup>2</sup> or 15 &times; 9<br>A1 cao"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "Corresponding sides are 5&nbsp;cm and 15&nbsp;cm.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Scale factor <i>k</i> = <sup>15</sup>&frasl;<sub>5</sub> = <b>3</b>",
      "divide a length on <i>B</i> by the corresponding length on <i>A</i>"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "Area scale factor = <i>k</i><sup>2</sup> = 3<sup>2</sup> = 9",
      "areas of similar shapes are in the ratio <i>k</i><sup>2</sup>"
     ],
     [
      "Area of <i>B</i> = 15 &times; 9 = <b>135&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup></b>",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Check: <i>A</i> is 5 by 3 and <i>B</i> is 15 by 9, giving 15&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup> and 135&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup> \u2713",
      ""
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
