   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 210\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig\" role=\"img\">\n<line x1=\"66.00\" y1=\"176.00\" x2=\"138.00\" y2=\"176.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"138.00\" y1=\"176.00\" x2=\"84.00\" y2=\"96.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"84.00\" y1=\"96.00\" x2=\"66.00\" y2=\"176.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"192.00\" y1=\"176.00\" x2=\"300.00\" y2=\"176.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"300.00\" y1=\"176.00\" x2=\"219.00\" y2=\"56.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"219.00\" y1=\"56.00\" x2=\"192.00\" y2=\"176.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"102.00\" y=\"200.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">6 cm</text>\n<text x=\"88.00\" y=\"86.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">T</text>\n<text x=\"223.00\" y=\"46.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">U</text>\n<text x=\"310\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">NOT TO</text>\n<text x=\"310\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">SCALE</text>\n</svg>",
   "stem": "<p>Triangle <i>T</i> and triangle <i>U</i> are mathematically similar.<br>Triangle <i>T</i> has area 20&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup> and triangle <i>U</i> has area 45&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Show that the length scale factor from <i>T</i> to <i>U</i> is 1.5.",
     "ans": "",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "The base of triangle <i>T</i> is 6&nbsp;cm.<br>Work out the length of the base of triangle <i>U</i>.",
     "ans": "",
     "unit": "cm",
     "m": 1
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "1.5",
     "2",
     "M1 for <sup>45</sup>&frasl;<sub>20</sub> = 2.25 or &radic;(<sup>45</sup>&frasl;<sub>20</sub>)<br>A1 nfww"
    ],
    [
     "9",
     "1",
     "B1<br>6 &times; 1.5"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "Area scale factor = <sup>45</sup>&frasl;<sub>20</sub> = 2.25",
      "divide the larger area by the smaller area"
     ],
     [
      "Length scale factor = &radic;2.25",
      "the area factor is <i>k</i><sup>2</sup>"
     ],
     [
      "<i>k</i> = <b>1.5</b>",
      ""
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "Base of <i>U</i> = 6 &times; 1.5",
      "multiply the corresponding length by <i>k</i>"
     ],
     [
      "Base of <i>U</i> = <b>9&nbsp;cm</b>",
      ""
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
