   "svg": null,
   "stem": "<p>Two solid statues are mathematically similar and are made from the same metal.<br>The smaller statue has height 15&nbsp;cm and the larger statue has height 24&nbsp;cm.<br>The mass of the smaller statue is 2.5&nbsp;kg and its total surface area is 550&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>.</p>",
