  {
   "n": 6,
   "marks": 4,
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig\" role=\"img\">\n<line x1=\"210.00\" y1=\"52.00\" x2=\"335.00\" y2=\"292.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"335.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"85.00\" y2=\"292.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"85.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"210.00\" y2=\"52.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"285.00\" y1=\"196.00\" x2=\"135.00\" y2=\"196.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"210.00\" cy=\"52.00\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n<circle cx=\"335.00\" cy=\"292.00\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n<circle cx=\"85.00\" cy=\"292.00\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n<circle cx=\"285.00\" cy=\"196.00\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n<circle cx=\"135.00\" cy=\"196.00\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n<text x=\"210.00\" y=\"40.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">A</text>\n<text x=\"350.00\" y=\"300.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">B</text>\n<text x=\"70.00\" y=\"300.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">C</text>\n<text x=\"301.00\" y=\"200.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">D</text>\n<text x=\"119.00\" y=\"200.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">E</text>\n<text x=\"275.50\" y=\"128.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">6 cm</text>\n<text x=\"338.00\" y=\"248.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">4 cm</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">NOT TO</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">SCALE</text>\n</svg>",
   "stem": "<p>In triangle <i>ABC</i>, <i>D</i> lies on <i>AB</i> and <i>E</i> lies on <i>AC</i>, and <i>DE</i> is parallel to <i>BC</i>.<br><i>AD</i> = 6&nbsp;cm, <i>DB</i> = 4&nbsp;cm and the area of triangle <i>ABC</i> is 75&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup>.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Calculate the area of triangle <i>ADE</i>.",
     "ans": "",
     "unit": "cm<sup>2</sup>",
     "m": 3
    },
    {
     "t": "Work out the area of the trapezium <i>DBCE</i>.",
     "ans": "",
     "unit": "cm<sup>2</sup>",
     "m": 1
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "27",
     "3",
     "M1 for length scale factor <sup>6</sup>&frasl;<sub>10</sub> = 0.6 oe<br>M1 for 75 &times; 0.6<sup>2</sup> or 75 &times; 0.36<br>A1 cao"
    ],
    [
     "48",
     "1",
     "B1<br>75 &minus; 27<br>FT 75 &minus; their (a)"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "<i>DE</i> is parallel to <i>BC</i>, so triangles <i>ADE</i> and <i>ABC</i> are similar.",
      "equal corresponding angles"
     ],
     [
      "<i>AB</i> = 6 + 4 = 10&nbsp;cm, so <i>k</i> = <sup><i>AD</i></sup>&frasl;<sub><i>AB</i></sub> = <sup>6</sup>&frasl;<sub>10</sub> = 0.6",
      "compare <i>AD</i> with the whole side <i>AB</i>"
     ],
     [
      "Area factor = 0.6<sup>2</sup> = 0.36",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Area of <i>ADE</i> = 75 &times; 0.36 = <b>27&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup></b>",
      ""
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "The trapezium is what is left when triangle <i>ADE</i> is removed from triangle <i>ABC</i>.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Area of <i>DBCE</i> = 75 &minus; 27 = <b>48&nbsp;cm<sup>2</sup></b>",
      ""
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
