   "stem": "<p>A container is in the shape of a cone with the point at the bottom.<br>The cone has height 24&nbsp;cm and its volume is 1500&nbsp;cm<sup>3</sup>.<br>The container holds water to a depth of 18&nbsp;cm.</p>",
